   "candidate": "```python\ndef merge_intervals(intervals):\n    if not intervals:\n        return []\n    \n    intervals.sort(key=lambda x: x[0])\n    \n    merged = []\n    current = intervals[0]\n    \n    for interval in intervals[1:]:\n        if interval[0] <= current[1]:\n            current[1] = max(current[1], interval[1])\n        else:\n            merged.append(current)\n            current = interval\n    \n    merged.append(current)\n    return merged\n```",
